    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;be a vector which makes equal angles with the coordinate axes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>Z</mi></math>. Also, let the projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;on the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;.&nbsp;Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be a vector obtained by rotating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis are coplanar, then projection of a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
